@Prac_10_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### 1. Get all students
GET {{Prac_10_HostAddress}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get student by ID
GET {{Prac_10_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Add a new student
POST {{Prac_10_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Manish Sharma",
  "email": "manish.sharma@gmail.com",
  "course": "Computer Engineering",
  "age": 21
}

### 4. Update an existing student
PUT {{Prac_10_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aarav Sharma",
  "email": "aarav.sharma@gmail.com",
  "course": "Computer Engineering",
  "age": 22
}

### 5. Delete a student
DELETE {{Prac_10_HostAddress}}/api/students/4
Accept: application/json

### 6. Weather Forecast (Template endpoint)
GET {{Prac_10_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json
